2026-03-09 17:20:06 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '6843d8cf000000000b01e7b5', 'create_time': 1749276880000, 'ip_location': '四川', 'note_id': '670e4a350000000024018e21', 'content': '确实是属于简单事情复杂化，小时候我们学的减法就是个位不够减就在十位借一个数，然后点一点，一步就出来了，多简单啊', 'user_id': '5b62c4f002680f000139d3b9', 'nickname': '爱吃抄手的小朋友', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31l5virbmio704a8aj62f1ktpjf9q6m8?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': '10', 'pictures': 'http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603091720/2ac62800501e6469e95adea668e0bf21/comment/1040g2h031idueodqga004a8aj62f1ktpn0q7v00!nd_whgt34_webp_wm_1', 'parent_comment_id': 0, 'last_modify_ts': 1773048006262, 'like_count': '19'}
