2026-03-09 20:09:31 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '682befe5000000000b02e959', 'create_time': 1747709926000, 'ip_location': '浙江', 'note_id': '67516b3f000000000201a34b', 'content': '学到了，还要把做过的练习再拿出来，课内同步的时候再看下错题。娃每天校内的作业真的非常快。几分钟就做完了。', 'user_id': '5d1215af000000001600a473', 'nickname': '爱笑的眼睛', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/5d13892facd38400013dbe65.jpg?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '67539e4900000000070023f2', 'last_modify_ts': 1773058171465, 'like_count': '0'}
