2026-03-09 20:09:37 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '69a02b0b000000000600def3', 'create_time': 1772104460000, 'ip_location': '广西', 'note_id': '698487f5000000001a034e7f', 'content': '孩子能够通过自主阅读学习相应课程，平时开学后有时间会给他同步进行浅奥的训练。', 'user_id': '607ee192000000000100a303', 'nickname': '杨@', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/607ee192000000000100a303.jpg?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '699dc45b000000000f02cc51', 'last_modify_ts': 1773058177237, 'like_count': '0'}
2026-03-09 20:09:37 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '69a04300000000000f01e811', 'create_time': 1772110593000, 'ip_location': '河南', 'note_id': '698487f5000000001a034e7f', 'content': '孩子有能力，精力应该逐步的放在浅奥上，超前学的目的，更多的是服务奥数学习，这一点很重要', 'user_id': '6534f047000000000301fb16', 'nickname': '遇见飞飞妈｜小学陪娃', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31rpv7g9m2s005p9ku13gruomcor8qd0?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '69a02b0b000000000600def3', 'last_modify_ts': 1773058177249, 'like_count': '0'}
2026-03-09 20:09:37 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '69a04cd7000000000600eb24', 'create_time': 1772113111000, 'ip_location': '广西', 'note_id': '698487f5000000001a034e7f', 'content': '嗯嗯！浅奥一周一次课，应该够了吧？', 'user_id': '607ee192000000000100a303', 'nickname': '杨@', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/607ee192000000000100a303.jpg?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '69a04300000000000f01e811', 'last_modify_ts': 1773058177259, 'like_count': '0'}
2026-03-09 20:09:37 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '69a05030000000001803a626', 'create_time': 1772113969000, 'ip_location': '河南', 'note_id': '698487f5000000001a034e7f', 'content': '我们也是一周一次课，重点是跟着课程节奏认真复盘、完成作业，错题订正，讲题。', 'user_id': '6534f047000000000301fb16', 'nickname': '遇见飞飞妈｜小学陪娃', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31rpv7g9m2s005p9ku13gruomcor8qd0?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '69a04cd7000000000600eb24', 'last_modify_ts': 1773058177274, 'like_count': '0'}
2026-03-09 20:09:39 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '69a7ff6000000000050393c2', 'create_time': 1772617568000, 'ip_location': '河南', 'note_id': '698487f5000000001a034e7f', 'content': '你的思路也很对，适合孩子就行，校内，超前，浅奥进度很难拉平衡，就是要根据孩子情况来调整节奏，以学的扎实，效率高为导引', 'user_id': '6534f047000000000301fb16', 'nickname': '遇见飞飞妈｜小学陪娃', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31rpv7g9m2s005p9ku13gruomcor8qd0?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '69a7e6da000000000c0151ba', 'last_modify_ts': 1773058179927, 'like_count': '0'}
2026-03-09 20:09:40 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '69a81628000000000b036d69', 'create_time': 1772623401000, 'ip_location': '湖北', 'note_id': '698487f5000000001a034e7f', 'content': '请问你们当时奥数是和校内还是和超前进度保持同年级的呢？', 'user_id': '5bd4796b500ccd0001c74dfe', 'nickname': '月球的发卡', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31r0k1nht0a004bkv6usmmjfu1sj5d68?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '69a7ff6000000000050393c2', 'last_modify_ts': 1773058180082, 'like_count': '0'}
