2026-03-09 20:10:00 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '6751a62e0000000007017788', 'create_time': 1733404206000, 'ip_location': None, 'note_id': '67516b3f000000000201a34b', 'content': '校内我们就是跟着老师的安排来，然后自己做一些拔高。超前学的时候有的章节做的效果比较好，提前学的时候就适当提一些难度了。', 'user_id': '67288ad9000000001d02c712', 'nickname': '禹妈爱学习', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31aukr3me7g005pp8hbcndhoita547q8?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '675188650000000007016bca', 'last_modify_ts': 1773058200619, 'like_count': '0'}
2026-03-09 20:10:00 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '6865ba02000000001102de1e', 'create_time': 1751497218000, 'ip_location': '广东', 'note_id': '67516b3f000000000201a34b', 'content': '一样 学霸的假期计划里每天密密麻麻学习计划 娃都不拖拉也不贪玩 太难了', 'user_id': '5d58a873000000000100092d', 'nickname': 'Daisy', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31cktc4cg0m005naol1pg829d2kcbdc8?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '67530fee00000000070171ca', 'last_modify_ts': 1773058200628, 'like_count': '0'}
2026-03-09 20:10:00 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '673d5dc0000000001a011519', 'create_time': 1732074944000, 'ip_location': None, 'note_id': '6737272e000000001d03bb85', 'content': '还需要买除教材以外，还需要购买什么教辅资料', 'user_id': '56d3f72884edcd368726af0e', 'nickname': '爱你宝贝11', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/529594cd91bbf4c43608131bf9134bdc.jpg?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': '2', 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': 0, 'last_modify_ts': 1773058200652, 'like_count': '0'}
