2026-03-09 20:13:10 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:169) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note] xhs note: {'note_id': '66435d1d000000001e0310f0', 'type': 'normal', 'title': '睿爸|小学数学鸡娃路线5. 提前校内的示范', 'desc': '很多家长看了“小学数学鸡娃路线”系列后，对于提前校内的“过”把握的不好。因为想学的细是很容易的事情，只要把所有的知识点都当做重点，题题都做再加教辅即可。而过的粗却并不容易操作，因为这需要家长去判断所有知识点的重要程度，从而来决定不同的知识点在提前学时需要学到什么程度。所以这里单独开一篇说说提前校内的“过”。\n\t\n⚠️本文中提前校内学习之后会接小奥学习。\n\t\n⚠️本文中提前校内的最佳适用年级为小学1-4年级，其次为5-6年级，不适合初高中。\n\t\n🔸适用家长：有能力辅导小学校内数学的家长。\n\t\n🔸适用孩子：平级校内测试卷90+，至少85+的孩子。\n\t\n详细内容请查看图片，全文13图。🔝\n\t\n#睿爸[话题]#\xa0\xa0#睿爸小屋[话题]#\xa0\xa0#小学数学[话题]#\xa0\xa0#数学学习[话题]#\xa0#小学数学鸡娃路线', 'video_url': '', 'time': 1715731290000, 'last_update_time': 1715690782000, 'user_id': '5b5f3c584eacab76c425faf2', 'nickname': '睿爸小屋', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/5b5f3cd3d1d3b91ecf920f94.jpg', 'liked_count': '245', 'collected_count': '539', 'comment_count': '27', 'share_count': '103', 'ip_location': '', 'image_list': 'http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092011/b9e8f86e14bb7fd1652dda09a54e0b17/spectrum/1040g34o312pf7lpq1o0g4a7mfsu5huniatpi3d0!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092011/db80e9292ce0cf6bb01a4fc00625e032/spectrum/1040g34o312pf7m0c1k0g4a7mfsu5huni9i69nh0!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092011/f6b4b7b3c791a8fc7a39c38e428305b3/spectrum/1040g0k0312pf7m24hk004a7mfsu5hunia22j5n8!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092011/dba42fb0d42cf05629fc7d970e9004c6/spectrum/1040g0k0312pf7m4dhk004a7mfsu5hunivid38po!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092011/7eb4ecd74d2f51b2156d1871d83079ab/spectrum/1040g34o312pf7mlchm0g4a7mfsu5huni24063fo!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092011/d70479060d4ef47a2b264c1b01444685/spectrum/1040g34o312pf7m6qho0g4a7mfsu5hunipep7dpg!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092011/261e036469aef34c0ee520561c5428b4/spectrum/1040g34o312pf7moo1m0g4a7mfsu5huni4nt41ao!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092011/b375bcd390b0ad269acb3f1616bc365c/spectrum/1040g0k0312pf7mft1k004a7mfsu5huni8c5iiq8!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092011/22ce457feaf68ea61f637ecc72f70a6c/spectrum/1040g34o312pf7mhqhk0g4a7mfsu5hunimlkul2g!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092011/eceecfc71311095e45811e2f80c84d4e/spectrum/1040g34o312pf7manhm0g4a7mfsu5huni1232d00!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092011/f769545f0ba348fa191fdf9fb772fa76/spectrum/1040g34o312pf7mr31q0g4a7mfsu5huni9trstk8!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092011/129d3978b4fc831176ddcf91da9b5b8e/spectrum/1040g0k0312pf7mjpho004a7mfsu5hunisns0lg0!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092011/e2ba1961e9d0ff9fa3cf89cd13efde93/spectrum/1040g0k0312pf7mbvhq004a7mfsu5hunirvlc3b8!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3', 'tag_list': '睿爸,睿爸小屋,小学数学,数学学习', 'last_modify_ts': 1773058390199, 'note_url': 'https://www.xiaohongshu.com/explore/66435d1d000000001e0310f0?xsec_token=ABerz8vJxesWnAyM2_gyB9uzCQo1sdLpfJkogVA7lw6fs=&xsec_source=pc_search', 'source_keyword': '#小学数学   #小学计算 #数学网课 #陪读经验   #提前学 #数学超前学', 'xsec_token': 'ABerz8vJxesWnAyM2_gyB9uzCQo1sdLpfJkogVA7lw6fs='}
