2026-03-09 20:14:44 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '64cd3379000000001c017d7f', 'create_time': 1691169657000, 'ip_location': None, 'note_id': '64c875fd000000001700f672', 'content': '我就都是丢下学期课本自己学。配基本练习当作预习，为啥提前学这么排斥，预习的定义就是自己学会，学不会听课啊。这不就是培养自学的能力。', 'user_id': '5d146fba000000001100917c', 'nickname': 'Sherry', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/5d146fba000000001100917c.jpg?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': '0', 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': 0, 'last_modify_ts': 1773058484319, 'like_count': '1'}
2026-03-09 20:14:44 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '64ccd49f000000002d01bf7b', 'create_time': 1691145375000, 'ip_location': None, 'note_id': '64c875fd000000001700f672', 'content': '看孩子性格。我家老大超前学，上课依然很认真，老二没给他超前学，上课一样走神[暗中观察R][暗中观察R][暗中观察R]', 'user_id': '5fa6bef6000000000100bac7', 'nickname': '哈哈哈', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo30vd2u8n05s6g5nt6nrr09em71c2q498?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': '0', 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': 0, 'last_modify_ts': 1773058484323, 'like_count': '0'}
