2026-03-09 20:20:51 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '697a61ae000000000800e9db', 'create_time': 1769628079000, 'ip_location': '广东', 'note_id': '69797d88000000001a02ef50', 'content': '解释一下：设x=0.99无限循坏 ，则10x=9.99无限循环，得出10x-x=9.99无限循环-0.99无限循环(9x=9)，最终x=1          因为x=1=0.99无限循环，所以1=0.99无限循环[飞吻R]', 'user_id': '5e285bf80000000001001ec8', 'nickname': '陈景深你繁不繁', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31t3pbbl55k005nh8bfs087m89q4g4l0?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '697a383b000000000f00ecb8', 'last_modify_ts': 1773058851638, 'like_count': '15'}
