2026-03-09 20:20:55 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '697abf5c000000000b036be9', 'create_time': 1769652061000, 'ip_location': '山东', 'note_id': '69797d88000000001a02ef50', 'content': '首先1/3转换成数字是0.3333333……那么3分之1×3=1 同样 0.33333……×3=0.999999……那么得出结论，0.999……=1', 'user_id': '67d6c113000000000e02c85f', 'nickname': '溯溪(脚踩雪月阁)', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31i5ah21d786g5pumo49jli2vd2bjhjg?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '697a383b000000000f00ecb8', 'last_modify_ts': 1773058855413, 'like_count': '0'}
