2026-03-09 20:21:41 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '6979e9cc0000000005031da6', 'create_time': 1769597388000, 'ip_location': '上海', 'note_id': '69797d88000000001a02ef50', 'content': '1÷3是0.33循环。但是0.33循环×3=0.99循环。所以0.99循环等于1。', 'user_id': '64e2d113000000000100fba3', 'nickname': '星屿（霸道流量爱上我）', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31slbm1fv56005p72q49g9ut3gn6tvv0?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '6979e500000000000503bbce', 'last_modify_ts': 1773058901397, 'like_count': '7'}
2026-03-09 20:21:41 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '6979ea6d000000000f01a88c', 'create_time': 1769597550000, 'ip_location': '江苏', 'note_id': '69797d88000000001a02ef50', 'content': '因为1/3＝0.333…  ＝1/3x3＝0.333…×3＝  1＝0.999…', 'user_id': '66fdfd53000000001d021b3b', 'nickname': '殷汐', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31rrk9v1tig6g5pntvl9nc6prkopbt9g?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '6979e500000000000503bbce', 'last_modify_ts': 1773058901402, 'like_count': '1'}
2026-03-09 20:21:41 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '697a0280000000000503a43b', 'create_time': 1769603713000, 'ip_location': '广东', 'note_id': '69797d88000000001a02ef50', 'content': '第四题是极限  0.9循环总会有一个头的比如一个圆形就几分之几几分之几一直占圆形的，几分之几后面会越来越小越来越小然后就到极限等于一个圆', 'user_id': '6044c2690000000001001314', 'nickname': '初音控', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31kapic8bj46g5o24o9kg84ok162jqug?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '6979e5ab0000000006031da6', 'last_modify_ts': 1773058901406, 'like_count': '0'}
