2026-03-09 20:22:00 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '6991436700000000030112ff', 'create_time': 1771127655000, 'ip_location': '江西', 'note_id': '69797d88000000001a02ef50', 'content': '那我就用你的方法，设（1）999….0=x，那么（2）999…0.0=10x，好，（1）-（2）=9而x-10x=-9x，则9=-9x，x=-1，所以也就是说-1=999…对吗？[黄金薯R]', 'user_id': '685fbcef000000001b0193b5', 'nickname': '魚🏓', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31ke65t2uj4kg5q2vnjnmr4tl12n0t9o?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '69913ad8000000000f0278ce', 'last_modify_ts': 1773058920703, 'like_count': '0'}
