2026-03-09 20:22:26 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '698b031d000000001500d085', 'create_time': 1770717982000, 'ip_location': '河北', 'note_id': '69797d88000000001a02ef50', 'content': '(1)设X=0.99....,(2)那么10X等于9.999......\n用(1)-(2)等于：\n10x-x=9.999.......-0.999\n       9x=9\n9x÷9=9÷9\n         x=1\n小学都解得出来，我求你了', 'user_id': '6894a7490000000028036fed', 'nickname': '雨の日-果松', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31stt77d5m25g5q4kkt4q6rvd72dtfl8?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': 'http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092022/8650ec8f02683b798cb7655134056476/comment/1040g4b831sda7tfn5k705q4kkt4q6rvd8c3ddj0!nd_whgt34_webp_wm_1', 'parent_comment_id': '697f0f39000000000600f103', 'last_modify_ts': 1773058946491, 'like_count': '0'}
2026-03-09 20:22:29 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '697d02ac0000000005032676', 'create_time': 1769800365000, 'ip_location': '江苏', 'note_id': '69797d88000000001a02ef50', 'content': '一个是除以，还有一个是除，不一样的', 'user_id': '66a30833000000000b033ca4', 'nickname': 'Liora🐟', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31tdgot4ble6g5pl310piuf54e9ftfng?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '697cd9a9000000000b0344c5', 'last_modify_ts': 1773058949147, 'like_count': '3'}
2026-03-09 20:22:29 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '697d8525000000001d00df4a', 'create_time': 1769833765000, 'ip_location': '山东', 'note_id': '69797d88000000001a02ef50', 'content': '除以前面的是被除数，除后面的是被除数，所以这道题应该是5除以10', 'user_id': '64757621000000001f00454d', 'nickname': '离云梦', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31sqg1ui4ls6g5p3leognohad73plilo?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '697cd9a9000000000b0344c5', 'last_modify_ts': 1773058949307, 'like_count': '0'}
2026-03-09 20:22:29 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '697ef64e000000000601edc1', 'create_time': 1769928271000, 'ip_location': '浙江', 'note_id': '69797d88000000001a02ef50', 'content': '@问一问  10除5=2吗', 'user_id': '63ff3386000000001f030161', 'nickname': '夜宵不吃夜宵（祝唐宫大爆）', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31ppbt0i0406g5ovv6e37u0b16d0vql0?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '697cd9a9000000000b0344c5', 'last_modify_ts': 1773058949313, 'like_count': '0'}
2026-03-09 20:22:29 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '697ef654000000000f02b855', 'create_time': 1769928277000, 'ip_location': None, 'note_id': '69797d88000000001a02ef50', 'content': '不是\n这是一个常见的数学“陷阱”题，关键在于“除”和“除以”的区别。\n“A除B”：表示的是 B ÷ A 。\n“A除以B”：表示的是 A ÷ B 。\n所以，“10除5”实际上是 5 ÷ 10 = 0.5 ，而不是2。', 'user_id': '68944c1e0000000028001164', 'nickname': '问一问', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2f031kojs3241u6g5plr93gmrfe5jkq0gvo', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '697ef64e000000000601edc1', 'last_modify_ts': 1773058949319, 'like_count': '0'}
