2026-03-09 20:28:34 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:169) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note] xhs note: {'note_id': '682a09240000000023011a77', 'type': 'normal', 'title': '四下从5.19开始"三轮复习法"，期末稳进前三', 'desc': '四下期末提前存下🙏考试95+\n1️⃣四下数学公式汇总及知识点总结，重点一目了然！\n2️⃣对应应用题难点突破。\n按这一套不信还有期末考不了95+的😭\n\t\n#提高孩子学习成绩[话题]# #小学数学公式[话题]# #应用题[话题]# #小学数学易错题[话题]# #易错题[话题]# #压轴题[话题]#   #期末[话题]# #高频考点[话题]#  #必考考点[话题]#  #四年级数学[话题]# #四年级下册数学[话题]# #四年级[话题]#', 'video_url': '', 'time': 1747585316000, 'last_update_time': 1747585316000, 'user_id': '5ffd3585000000000100aad3', 'nickname': '嘻嘻麻麻', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31r47p41h72005nvt6m2g9amj0ofrkh0', 'liked_count': '5157', 'collected_count': '7262', 'comment_count': '3078', 'share_count': '2223', 'ip_location': '', 'image_list': 'http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092026/1363d0926fe5f3f53e53c6b6eff210f5/notes_pre_post/1040g3k831hknpkac3ak05nvt6m2g9amju8fkbm8!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092026/f3ba181168d12e584241d9c73bcbc9b0/notes_pre_post/1040g3k831hknpkac3ai05nvt6m2g9amj4lbsnag!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092026/30ba8af178007563ba6c69a4e4ee7611/notes_pre_post/1040g3k031hknq3u338605nvt6m2g9amjthrvdng!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092026/ab185b48622d267b5471204fce405279/notes_pre_post/1040g3k031hknq3ttk2605nvt6m2g9amj12ft1co!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092026/17119caa5635b23e0ff9fba0db007e97/notes_pre_post/1040g3k031hknq3tu386g5nvt6m2g9amjh863ndg!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092026/7681ac882cc2dafc218e1fda891bb709/notes_pre_post/1040g3k031hknq3tukq5g5nvt6m2g9amje11kl20!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092026/b8eae1e5dcf26a583eebec12a8cd9a8a/notes_pre_post/1040g3k031hknq3tuja605nvt6m2g9amjief8geo!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092026/1177c6170fd3e28b349af8b383e5d129/notes_pre_post/1040g3k831hknpkac3ae05nvt6m2g9amjmopkveg!nd