2026-03-09 20:37:17 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:169) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note] xhs note: {'note_id': '61ca5e86000000002103e9c9', 'type': 'normal', 'title': '小学数学必背的16大知识要点（一）', 'desc': '数学老师反复强调：小学数学根本就不用报什么辅导班。课本的基础知识吃透，多做口算和四则混合运算，解决问题举一反三。\n家有小学生的存下这些知识点吧,汇集了1—6年级所学的重点公式,吃透不用去补习班。#孩子教育[话题]# #小学数学[话题]# #数学[话题]# #小学数学怎么学[话题]#', 'video_url': '', 'time': 1640652422000, 'last_update_time': 1640652423000, 'user_id': '5f64177b000000000100b593', 'nickname': 'ginkgo30', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo318equnmv3u5g5nr42ttg9dcj4clf5no', 'liked_count': '1687', 'collected_count': '1749', 'comment_count': '14', 'share_count': '223', 'ip_location': '', 'image_list': 'http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092035/cae4bde71770ce3821503bf51e332746/ae03f3c8-82e6-3f63-a9e5-a99b8814d492!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092035/28422d53fd4d003874dabd0b510f2a9f/dc441efd-d060-3647-bafa-5e52d89a3a7e!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092035/69254dc3d596330fe59ea35f3975d3d6/c43bf3a9-0156-3365-bae8-3a8b335b6bc9!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092035/2add6476ade844aa58c7f60a66be9fe8/e2a7db3d-e01d-30b2-abbd-7b2faa147b09!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092035/eddfa71594d3179d783f8d6dd60c4ec2/1d1f2410-241c-3fe7-ad9b-017d696f9dc0!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092035/ec72b45d488f8f6f70b9bb36b8f396d7/d6ed82bc-d56e-3457-b89e-d771024758ef!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092035/53fbedc9fbedc550a717c49b61061950/357555a3-26bc-3930-af24-0eb7ead7cd8c!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092035/d6ab0088c28b18de2e72f0c5639aa5f2/c44c8df8-49a4-3a2c-9ffb-a4d9c13d6b9b!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092035/ca28726aafe3daaa463e9ca3cfcf047a/99b54e73-b1dd-341d-9cc9-2c890202340e!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3', 'tag_list': '孩子教育,小学数学,数学,小学数学怎么学', 'last_modify_ts': 1773059837440, 'note_url': 'ht