差倍、归一归总、年龄、平均数、植树、周期问题、鸡免同笼。\n四年级:行程、盈亏、牛吃草、列方程解应用题。\n五年级:分数应用题，比例应用题、工程问题。\n\t\n六年级:度、利润、百分数应用题、各种应用题综合)。\n应用题要花费的时间很久，只要计算能力过关，理解能力跟得上，应用题不分几年级内容，都可以按照模块超前进行。\n#小学数学怎么学[话题]# #小学数学超前学[话题]#', 'interact_info': {'collected_count': '2339', 'comment_count': '61', 'share_count': '206', 'followed': False, 'relation': 'none', 'liked': False, 'liked_count': '1339', 'collected': False}, 'image_list': [{'width': 920, 'url': 'http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092036/fc515d6a52821cd0bff2ff8fdded96c3/notes_pre_post/1040g3k831c57csulh0605ntcrumgbkdab1m1rv8!nd_dft_wgth_webp_3', 'trace_id': '', 'info_list': [{'image_scene': 'WB_PRV', 'url': 'http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092036/abc9cac9ede201813a063715a101e739/notes_pre_post/1040g3k831c57csulh0605ntcrumgbkdab1m1rv8!nd_prv_wgth_webp_3'}, {'image_scene': 'WB_DFT', 'url': 'http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092036/fc515d6a52821cd0bff2ff8fdded96c3/notes_pre_post/1040g3k831c57csulh0605ntcrumgbkdab1m1rv8!nd_dft_wgth_webp_3'}], 'url_pre': 'http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092036/abc9cac9ede201813a063715a101e739/notes_pre_post/1040g3k831c57csulh0605ntcrumgbkdab1m1rv8!nd_prv_wgth_webp_3', 'url_default': 'http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092036/fc515d6a52821cd0bff2ff8fdded96c3/notes_pre_post/1040g3k831c57csulh0605ntcrumgbkdab1m1rv8!nd_dft_wgth_webp_3', 'file_id': '', 'height': 780, 'stream': {}, 'live_photo': False}], 'at_user_list': [], 'note_id': '67764f4a000000000b0217dc', 'type': 'normal', 'time': 1735806794000, 'last_update_time': 1735806795000, 'share_info': {'un_share': False}, 'user': {'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31mhkb1au586g5ntcrumgbkda38o7g2g', 'xsec_token': 'ABn1kQjcxvC00BAbQa61NRQe5uM-kgoQZWHxQWga9042w=', 'user_id': '5facdfad000000000101d1aa', 'nickname': '宝妈在山东'}, 'tag_list': [{'id': '5bf4db8dd31585000198efb2', 'name': '小学数学怎么学', 'type': 'topic'}, {'id': '6318123a00000000010067ce', 'name': '小学数学超前学', 'type': 'topic'}], 'xsec_token': 'ABosNfbjLOl_N3DD08JBS3kAcb9xjBooW26p05I