2026-03-09 20:46:42 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:169) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note] xhs note: {'note_id': '697b47c4000000000a03f6f8', 'type': 'normal', 'title': '数学突然变好，大部分时候都不是靠刷题', 'desc': '很多家长这几年钱没少花，但连孩子真正的病灶在哪都不知道。复盘是提升成绩的关键习惯，通过分析错题、明确原因并提问，真正掌握知识点和解题思路。每天花15分钟进行真复盘，能显著减少错误，比报辅导班更有效。#数学[话题]##小学数学[话题]##初中数学[话题]##数学思维[话题]##数学老师[话题]##提分技巧[话题]##数学一对一[话题]##网课[话题]##学习经验[话题]##提高孩子学习成绩[话题]#', 'video_url': '', 'time': 1769686980000, 'last_update_time': 1769686981000, 'user_id': '6780bbb9000000000803c052', 'nickname': '睿睿爸爸成长课堂（泓君）', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/678282baeb49cb0001b35ab8.jpg', 'liked_count': '798', 'collected_count': '1382', 'comment_count': '44', 'share_count': '862', 'ip_location': '', 'image_list': 'http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092045/c9133b08db5592fc30d0b755df7a8cdc/1040g00831rsto4v2i6005ps0nesi7g2i0ms3hho!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092045/ed5204ae088cf35c8bc17f0e6c154c11/1040g00831rsto4v2i6605ps0nesi7g2io4jdb5g!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092045/f0945c351bded9fd133a5754f158c133/1040g00831ru2o5gci8505ps0nesi7g2ip8rf5ig!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092045/e6ae1e43afafd90b9cb518028b0260f6/1040g2sg31ru2o5iv26dg5ps0nesi7g2idljuisg!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092045/46c6be94b6e8388bb4e73d075f0de92a/1040g00831ru2o5gci85g5ps0nesi7g2i3mv3mao!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092045/42cc04ac0a3f5096394a7fa868af8141/1040g00831rsto4v2i6205ps0nesi7g2ikjkv3f0!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092045/4ec3ddc31e03b35d2c2cd3b7b4ff78b5/1040g00831rsto4v2i6405ps0nesi7g2ih28ur1o!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092045/2f7c0de7f048a2befd2fb19fdd562a90/1040g00831rsto4v2i6505ps0nesi7g2inhcuki0!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092045/e119ba1d75f7bcdf8f0d30fc0500e1ef/1040g00831rsto4v2i6105ps0nesi7g2igfd7m80!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3'