2026-03-09 20:46:48 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:169) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note] xhs note: {'note_id': '69aa71dc000000001b0165d2', 'type': 'normal', 'title': '五年级下册数学计算一课一练（人教版50页）', 'desc': '家长和老师们催更的五下“计算专项”一课一练来啦，每日一练完整版50页。\n人教版五下计算是五年级下册的核心考点，考试占比高，与计算相关的题目占到一多半，五年级计算是六年级乃至初中数学的基础，必须要重点对待，家长和老师抓紧安排上吧！\n#五年级下册数学[话题]# #人教版五下数学[话题]# #一课一练[话题]# #五年级下册计算题专项[话题]# #五下数学计算每日一练[话题]# #五年级下册数学计算题[话题]#', 'video_url': '', 'time': 1772777948000, 'last_update_time': 1772777948000, 'user_id': '5c56faaf000000001a02031a', 'nickname': '小杨老师教数学', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/6684b230239fb0f0db0ca98f.jpg', 'liked_count': '779', 'collected_count': '700', 'comment_count': '653', 'share_count': '145', 'ip_location': '福建', 'image_list': 'http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092045/fdb0917e8140108b3aa42fa1517037a6/1040g00831tbtplos5k505n2mvanmk0oqn4m4qu8!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092045/9a48632cedb58e5ecb081d62512f9db5/1040g00831tbtplos5k5g5n2mvanmk0oq9mjdong!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092045/9a4d8a68c60f3a3f82e10e436a8eeb05/1040g00831tbtplos5k605n2mvanmk0oqovg82ag!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092045/e0864d182f358c37fa53bb65ab04cd65/1040g00831tbtplos5k6g5n2mvanmk0oqja7pi2g!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092045/3cc957028407cd74a23c7944a10913ee/1040g00831tc4kh8c5k005n2mvanmk0oqs29qkuo!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092045/f4a1e8d1fcac0c0d8c2d72c5696b4f16/1040g00831tc4kh8c5k0g5n2mvanmk0oqb3mp8ho!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092045/f668f00151daa91d6703a2f475adda58/1040g00831tc4kh8c5k105n2mvanmk0oqcgnral8!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092045/39a7edeb249c76ecd6aa863b0024119f/1040g00831tc4kh8c5k1g5n2mvanmk0oqlijr640!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092045/23b07be09b35ad51757a19d813ff295f/1040g00831tc4kh8c5k205n2mvanmk0oqaso8k6g!nd_dft_wlteh_w