2026-03-09 21:10:25 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:169) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note] xhs note: {'note_id': '69ae282e000000001503b595', 'type': 'normal', 'title': '二年级下册数学计算一课一练（人教版50页）', 'desc': '最近很多老师和家长催我更新26春二下“计算专项”一课一练，每日一练完整版50页。\n二年级下册数学计算题是整个小学阶段的“地基”，全册核心就是计算，直接决定了三年级能不能跟上，这个年级很容易粗心，这可不是小问题，大多数是因为口诀不熟，不验算导致的，一课一练能帮助孩子把计算题练熟，练稳，老师和家长们赶紧给孩子准备上吧。\n#二年级下册数学[话题]# #人教版二下数学[话题]# #一课一练[话题]# #计算题专项[话题]# #二下数学计算专项[话题]# #每日一练[话题]# #数学启蒙[话题]# #计算题训练[话题]#', 'video_url': '', 'time': 1773021230000, 'last_update_time': 1773021231000, 'user_id': '5c56faaf000000001a02031a', 'nickname': '小杨老师教数学', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/6684b230239fb0f0db0ca98f.jpg', 'liked_count': '100', 'collected_count': '99', 'comment_count': '69', 'share_count': '28', 'ip_location': '福建', 'image_list': 'http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092108/6e5708e22866cf38c70271a086bbd742/notes_pre_post/1040g3k831tfocknp5k705n2mvanmk0oqus32dbg!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092108/a87eec86d0a7c9dd4682564f28bb370d/notes_pre_post/1040g3k831tfocknp5k7g5n2mvanmk0oqmcdkc3g!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092108/e7f09ccdf9f14d3937814018b943fb8e/notes_pre_post/1040g3k831tfocknp5k805n2mvanmk0oqa60p43o!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092108/ddeee4d4993263a26d9a1c4b613aae3f/notes_pre_post/1040g3k831tfocknp5k8g5n2mvanmk0oqg6vg2v0!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092108/992fe9f7cdb012b5642fef21fe9416b9/notes_pre_post/1040g3k831tfocknp5k905n2mvanmk0oq01eg0d8!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092108/428acac51a80b37494a9c36ff474c1fe/notes_pre_post/1040g3k831tfocknp5k9g5n2mvanmk0oqhv6delg!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092108/67c3acc5ab7c3df1ff4a70a0440d63b8/notes_pre_post/1040g3k831tfocknp5ka05n2mvanmk0oqnba8gqo!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092108/27b9eb195c87e07889645ec6ee13c199/notes_pre_post/1040g3k831tfocknp5kag5n