2026-03-09 21:55:09 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '69149b280000000037024412', 'create_time': 1762958120000, 'ip_location': '吉林', 'note_id': '6909a9c900000000030377b0', 'content': '对，别觉得简单，99%的学生计算功底从小学开始就差一点，初中又差一点，已学过公式下的计算能力离心算秒出差得远了。', 'user_id': '5a573f86e8ac2b5d53c0cfe7', 'nickname': 'Moomin', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/6612642c12c2274ac8d5d1b0.jpg?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '691492970000000039007760', 'last_modify_ts': 1773064509119, 'like_count': '0'}
2026-03-09 21:55:09 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '691510cc0000000039023b5c', 'create_time': 1762988236000, 'ip_location': '江苏', 'note_id': '6909a9c900000000030377b0', 'content': '个人觉得看孩子能力，咱普娃不具备提前学的底层能力。底层能力够的孩子超不超前学都行', 'user_id': '61150c58000000000100187f', 'nickname': '英雄拔出宝剑', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo312snotri426g5o8l1hc0863v0es5ge8?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '691157850000000033021c9c', 'last_modify_ts': 1773064509123, 'like_count': '0'}
