2026-03-09 22:07:14 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '688ee967000000002b01fc5a', 'create_time': 1754196327000, 'ip_location': '北京', 'note_id': '687ec21e000000002400f925', 'content': '正确率能保持90%以上就行', 'user_id': '646c05f60000000010024b5b', 'nickname': '露从今夜白', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31kgn2g7j346g5p3c0nr44iqrarmm54o?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '688ecb6d000000002b00626a', 'last_modify_ts': 1773065234066, 'like_count': '0'}
2026-03-09 22:07:14 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '688ee9ef000000002b0236e3', 'create_time': 1754196463000, 'ip_location': '辽宁', 'note_id': '687ec21e000000002400f925', 'content': '所以不强求运算过程上草稿纸呗。我们是不上草稿纸的话，准确率时高时低，80-95%之间反复横跳。我再观察下，如果上了草稿纸也就这样，那我就不强求了[捂脸R]', 'user_id': '5f73079300000000010002b5', 'nickname': '贴地飞行躺平姐', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/5f73079300000000010002b5.jpg?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '688ee967000000002b01fc5a', 'last_modify_ts': 1773065234071, 'like_count': '0'}
2026-03-09 22:07:14 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '688eea9e000000002b01e180', 'create_time': 1754196638000, 'ip_location': '北京', 'note_id': '687ec21e000000002400f925', 'content': '不用强制要求，设定正确率目标，完不成要有相应惩罚，完成好有奖励。小孩如果达不到他会自己想办法', 'user_id': '646c05f60000000010024b5b', 'nickname': '露从今夜白', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31kgn2g7j346g5p3c0nr44iqrarmm54o?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '688ee9ef000000002b0236e3', 'last_modify_ts': 1773065234076, 'like_count': '0'}
2026-03-09 22:07:14 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '688eeae6000000002b015425', 'create_time': 1754196710000, 'ip_location': '辽宁', 'note_id': '687ec21e000000002400f925', 'content': '嗯。本来是觉得运算过程上草稿纸帮助思考，也提升运算能力。如果不是一定能提升，那其实真的是她想怎么写就怎么写吧。惩罚也罚了，奖励也奖励了，飘忽不定。再观察看看吧', 'user_id': '5f73079300000000010002b5', 'nickname': '贴地飞行躺平姐', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/5f73079300000000010002b5.jpg?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '688eea9e000000002b01e180', 'last_modify_ts': 1773065234081, 'like_count': '0'}
