2026-03-09 22:44:53 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '691a6bab0000000033020b61', 'create_time': 1763339179000, 'ip_location': '山东', 'note_id': '6909a9c900000000030377b0', 'content': '真是这样，初中以后有拔高题压轴题以后，靠提前学的那点皮毛很难做到分数上有很大优势，反而花了更多时间去学皮毛，而不是深入培养解决难题的能力', 'user_id': '5fa2aa270000000001003e85', 'nickname': 'Momooo', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo30p2uo5lsjq005nt2l8jg8fk5kb8qah0?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '69127f73000000003803c17c', 'last_modify_ts': 1773067493329, 'like_count': '2'}
2026-03-09 22:44:53 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '691a6d410000000039007298', 'create_time': 1763339586000, 'ip_location': '江苏', 'note_id': '6909a9c900000000030377b0', 'content': '80%的知识点只要花20%的时间就可以学完，剩下20%才是决定性的，反而需要80%的时间花在上面', 'user_id': '656a9037000000001c0193e8', 'nickname': '小红薯656B02C3', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31ppdpg54l26g5pbai0rn34v81c28sco?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '691a6bab0000000033020b61', 'last_modify_ts': 1773067493476, 'like_count': '0'}
2026-03-09 22:44:53 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '691ab75e0000000038012b1b', 'create_time': 1763358559000, 'ip_location': '江苏', 'note_id': '6909a9c900000000030377b0', 'content': '人家小学很聪明的，初中过来也是班级3名。就是六年级学到初二初三', 'user_id': '656a9037000000001c0193e8', 'nickname': '小红薯656B02C3', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31ppdpg54l26g5pbai0rn34v81c28sco?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '691aad660000000039021949', 'last_modify_ts': 1773067493485, 'like_count': '0'}
2026-03-09 22:44:53 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '691abffb000000003902cf20', 'create_time': 1763360764000, 'ip_location': '江苏', 'note_id': '6909a9c900000000030377b0', 'content': '跟你说了，小学生六年级绝对不可能学初三的，他那个学只是皮毛，不是深入。我家就是小学六年级，目前就是学到初二，但是水平还是不够强，比不过初二的普通学生。', 'user_id': '5d60a4410000000001006424', 'nickname': 'Tenslin', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31qn5ul0e0m4g5nb0kh0g8p14iu85f7g?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '691ab75e0000000038012b1b', 'last_modify_ts': 1773067493495, 'like_count': '1'}
