2026-03-09 23:05:15 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:169) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note] xhs note: {'note_id': '699d2a3a000000001a030671', 'type': 'normal', 'title': '新三下数学《除数是一位数的除法》每日一练', 'desc': '26春三下《除数是一位数的除法》专项练习40页，主要包含5类题型:\n1️⃣两位数除以一位数；\n2️⃣三位数除以一位数；\n3️⃣商中间有0️⃣的除法；\n4️⃣商末尾有0️⃣的除法；\n5️⃣带余数的三位数除以一位数。\n每天20题，一天一页，提高熟练度和准确率🚀\n#三年级数学下册[话题]# #三下计算题[话题]# #除法竖式[话题]# #除数是一位数的除法[话题]# #小学数学易错题[话题]# #专项练习[话题]# #计算[话题]# #每日一练[话题]# #笔算除法[话题]# #三年级下册数学[话题]#', 'video_url': '', 'time': 1771907643000, 'last_update_time': 1771907643000, 'user_id': '5d94a7880000000001004b1f', 'nickname': '梅子老师提分资料SY', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31okcvrhh6m605nckku408iovbdsf0a8', 'liked_count': '55', 'collected_count': '73', 'comment_count': '', 'share_count': '10', 'ip_location': '湖北', 'image_list': 'http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092303/8a283f57e401d8e2969d0446a29e7337/notes_pre_post/1040g3k031sv5i5ju5m6g5nckku408iovev0cm18!nd_dft_wlteh_jpg_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092303/7a234c0aa0136b3dff6f7c1cbf1740d8/notes_pre_post/1040g3k031sv5i5ju5m1g5nckku408iov7mblkk8!nd_dft_wlteh_jpg_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092303/cf9548132ee363a802d6a8c751fc242e/notes_pre_post/1040g3k031sv5i5ju5m5g5nckku408iov8b361oo!nd_dft_wlteh_jpg_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092303/e539217ac9f092e5734406c723e95dc5/notes_pre_post/1040g3k031sv5i5ju5m4g5nckku408iovkikp1p0!nd_dft_wlteh_jpg_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092303/0739a2e3352e0fe61e73e8302ba4514d/notes_pre_post/1040g3k031sv5i5ju5m305nckku408iovlsju4j8!nd_dft_wlteh_jpg_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092303/dee03e93d386a4534f02c5a026f73936/notes_pre_post/1040g3k031sv5i5ju5m2g5nckku408iovhddd95g!nd_dft_wlteh_jpg_3', 'tag_list': '三年级数学下册,三下计算题,除法竖式,除数是一位数的除法,小学数学易错题,专项练习,计算,每日一练,笔算除法,三年级下册数学', 'last_modify_ts': 1773068715402, 'note_url': 'https://www.xiaohongshu.com/explore/699d2a3a000000001a030671?xsec_token=ABcIsu6TEfbj4bbHURdQ3vPo6Ro8P99LHIfv0p1F72m1U=&xsec_source=pc_search'