2026-03-09 23:05:33 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:169) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note] xhs note: {'note_id': '69481dca000000001e00efff', 'type': 'normal', 'title': '数学老师是怎么帮自己孩子选网课的（无广告', 'desc': '越来越临近寒假期末，我发现小红书上关于数学网课的广告越来越多。\n\t\n分享作为数学老师，我当初给自己孩子选择网课的时候，考虑了哪些维度？\n\t\n在这里不打广告，只说方法。如果大家有好的推荐，也可以在评论区分享。\n\t\n#数学思维[话题]# #学习习惯[话题]# #网课[话题]#  #学习规划[话题]# #小学数学[话题]# #寒假逆袭[话题]# #期末复习[话题]# #期末考试[话题]#', 'video_url': '', 'time': 1766362681000, 'last_update_time': 1766333899000, 'user_id': '68aea15d0000000019012bbd', 'nickname': '说数学的乐爸', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31lm7ldou5m605q5ek5emaatt6tr5oh8', 'liked_count': '41', 'collected_count': '52', 'comment_count': '23', 'share_count': '7', 'ip_location': '', 'image_list': 'http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092303/8b35c8ac1820dd1608772554d6ea81dd/1040g00831qc3nrcvn06g5q5ek5emaatt5mcpgh8!nd_dft_wlteh_jpg_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092303/158eecb6659faaabbf9f5e2ae2a5289d/1040g00831qc3nrcvn00g5q5ek5emaatt5oethu8!nd_dft_wlteh_jpg_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092303/bb51f7a594e64470324cf851ece51e5a/1040g00831qc3nrcvn0305q5ek5emaattdrjh6ng!nd_dft_wlteh_jpg_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092303/fd5470ba0056361c2db9c94b2a447d68/1040g00831qc3nrcvn0605q5ek5emaattrh89mp0!nd_dft_wlteh_jpg_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092303/d0c98ede6e7dabbc5e04eed3e3064755/1040g00831qc3nrcvn0105q5ek5emaattdbbe5h8!nd_dft_wlteh_jpg_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092303/d4364c9bab5d3032b6cbfa3e12108112/1040g00831qc3nrcvn01g5q5ek5emaattrtf1b8o!nd_dft_wlteh_jpg_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092303/a9f6b6858a66e2e520964b6d2d3a9dc7/1040g00831qc3nrcvn0205q5ek5emaattt830i00!nd_dft_wlteh_jpg_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092303/2062f3672ea5e4d8691c14935e1dc708/1040g00831qc3nrcvn03g5q5ek5emaatt4eklct8!nd_dft_wlteh_jpg_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603092303/643e52a5216ee3bc36e12f72d365ebb5/1040g00831qc3nrcvn0405q5ek5emaatt8l6hva8!nd_dft_wlteh_jpg_3,http: