2026-03-09 23:08:02 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '6731d008000000001a024f71', 'create_time': 1731317768000, 'ip_location': None, 'note_id': '6728797e000000003c014977', 'content': '准备就预习。跟着课本', 'user_id': '62393d24000000001000e958', 'nickname': 'cute cat', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo319lgjp44mo6g5ohp7ki41qaoa210ii8?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '67319e1100000000180281cb', 'last_modify_ts': 1773068882908, 'like_count': '0'}
2026-03-09 23:08:02 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:226) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '6731d2c10000000019003f89', 'create_time': 1731318466000, 'ip_location': None, 'note_id': '6728797e000000003c014977', 'content': '教完音标和26个字母，让她自己背单词，背满1000个以上基础词汇，简单的小短文就能自己读了。同时在学习机上跟读绘本，扩充词汇量。就像语文先学拼音然后自己认字，接着文章', 'user_id': '5c66a8ec000000001202bf9b', 'nickname': '石头', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/0dd6f7e91ce0bea602fbc47515b7c72f.jpg?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '6731cf2e0000000002005330', 'last_modify_ts': 1773068882920, 'like_count': '0'}
